LAST WEEK = the ISO week before this run's week (a run on any day of W42 reads W41). Read fileId `{{sources.ledger.id}}` by the SHEET READ RULE. Select rows by their first field (the week key; `週` in `Updates`), never by line position: the CSV drops empty rows. Follow the SHEET READ RULE's three limits — most Ledger tabs carry free text.
